Required to perform various Heavy Maintenance duties including, but not limited to:
Heavy Maintenance;
Analyse and understand aircraft blueprints, specifications, and maintenance manuals to make repairs;
Prepare surfaces and apply protective coatings to a variety of materials used on aircraft;
Fabricate parts as needed;
Conduct maintenance;
Order supplies, equipment, materials, and parts for repairs and general maintenance;
Safely operate various tools used for sheet metal applications;
Install, repair inspect, and replace sheet metal components on aircraft, including structural assemblies.
