Trade test Certificate;
Licensed AME with a SACAA B rating;
Minimum of ten (10) years aviation experience;
Previous experience working on B737 – 400 and -800;
Good knowledge and understanding of computers;
Valid South African passport holder;
Must be willing to work shifts, weekends and public holidays, and overtime as and when required;
Must be available and willing to travel at short notice, both locally and internationally;
Must have own Transport.
PERSONAL ATTRIBUTES:
Detailed orientated
Able to work under pressure and to follow instructions;
Committed to delivering quality work;
Proactive self-starter capable to function on his/her own without any supervision;
Immaculate time keeping.
