Demonstrated experience in radio access network technologies;
Knowledge and understanding of telecommunications protocols, RF fundamentals, digital signal processing, and multiple spectrum access techniques;
Knowledge and understanding of deep learning and/or machine learning and/or artificial intelligence;
Demonstrated experience in using software defined radios (SDR) and understanding of cognitive radio technology for spectrum sharing;
Knowledge of software tools and languages (such as C/C++, Python, Matlab) for either the development or testing of software;
