The CSIR has a vacancy for Software Engineer: Modelling and Simulation in the Optronic Sensor Systems (OSS) Impact Area within the Defence and Security Cluster. The incumbent will be responsible to develop simulation software for advanced optical scenario engagement simulation, and modelling of imaging, mechanical, electronic, radiometry and physical systems. This position is based in Pretoria.
