PURPOSE OF THE JOB
Responsible for the investigation and identification of all areas that may influence the safety and health of all employees within a designated area. Recommends procedure to minimise the injury frequency rate. Tasks involve planning, scheduling, controlling, inspecting, reporting and training. Must have knowledge of mines and works regulations and other relevant regulations. Assist with safety legal compliance and implementation of operational improvement measures and increased in the field.
KEY PERFORMANCE AREAS
Risk Management and Assessment
Assist with risk assessments and facilitate line managers and HOD's in implementing corrective and preventive actions where necessary;
