Demonstrated ability to:
Attract and successfully supervise postgraduate students and postdoctoral fellows;
Implement joint technology development programs with industries;
Generate IP and to commercialize innovation;
Mobilise financial resources from diverse funding sources;
Appointed at the level of Associate Professor or full Professor, benchmarked nationally.
Good communications and interpersonal skills.
