Bosch Projects, a member of the multi-disciplinary Bosch Holdings group of companies, founded in 1961, has an opportunity for a Senior Civil Engineer within the KZN Developments Team. This position will be based in Durban and reports directly to the Divisional Manager: Developments
KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:
Managing entire projects and project teams from inception to completion, including client interface;
Performing engineering functions efficiently in support of own projects and provide technical support to other projects.
Performing a contract administration role on major development projects;
Mentoring and motivating project teams;
Developing and maintaining strong client relationships;
Taking responsibility for work acquisition and tendering for civil projects;
Ensuring compliance with Bosch Projects ISO 9001/2008 QMS System;
Ensuring that client standards are achieved and maintained
Assisting the KZN Regional Director and Sector Head in planning resource requirements, and in recruiting suitable candidates.
